Extract native C desktop records and transport with a standalone build

Import bindings/c verbatim from Sophia 987cfd393a11edaa99e8b3c58be80d21167fb287. Preserve shell IPC and the WM socket codec as optional compatibility. Pin contracts and provenance; provide static libraries and pkg-config metadata.

Validation: nice 19 make -j2 check all, including literal file vectors, 9P scripted regressions, and the socket codec/lifecycle corpus. App lifecycle completion and production-export integration remain separate steps. Retain three upstream trailing-space lines in the immutable diod reference.
